  "id": "utility-theory",
  "term": "utility theory",
  "definition": "Utility theory here is a framework for describing subjective happiness, especially how current happiness is shaped by recent monetary conditions. It proposes that happiness is influenced through social comparison with other people and through self-adaptation to one’s own past conditions.",
